<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova industry output falls 14 pct yr/yr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Moldova industry output falls 14 pct yr/yr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output in February dropped 14 percent below the level of February last year, the State Statistics Department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    Feb '97   Jan '97   Feb '96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		 +14.00	n/a	+7.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	  -14.00    -18.0	-2.6</p>
<p>NOTE - January 1997 monthly change was not provided due to changes in calculation methodology, which made it incompatible with December data.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
